OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested after woman, 61,
OL,4,Afound dead
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested on suspicion of
OL,7,Fmurder after a woman was found dead.
OL,9,FCambridgeshire Police was called to a
OL,10,Fproperty on Alexandra Road, Wisbech, at
OL,11,Fabout 21:50 GMT on Saturday.
OL,13,FThe force said it had received reports
OL,14,Fthat the body of a 61-year-old woman
OL,15,Fhad been discovered inside.
OL,17,FOfficers arrested a 62-year-old man at
OL,18,Fthe scene, where specialist scenes of
OL,19,Fcrime officers remain and
OL,20,Finvestigations are ongoing.
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
